<title>CAMBODIA: Thailand charges Cambodian fisheries officials.</title>
<headline>Thailand charges Cambodian fisheries officials.</headline>
<dateline>PHNOM PENH 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai authorities have charged 11 Cambodian fisheries officials with illegally entering Thai waters, an embassy official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The official denied a Cambodian assertion that the 11, who were detained on September 23, were in Cambodian waters or waters claimed by both nations.</p>
<p>&quot;They were in Thai waters,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The diplomat said he learned on Sunday that the 11 have been charged with illegal entry, use of illegal firearms and illegal use of radio transmitters.</p>
</text>
